<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>While we pray for pard’ning grace,</l><l>Through the dear Redeemer’s name,</l><l>Show Thy reconciled face;</l><l>Take away our sin and shame:</l><l>From our worldly cares set free,</l><l>May we rest this day in Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Here we come Thy name to praise,</l><l>Let us feel Thy presence near;</l><l>May Thy glory meet our eyes,</l><l>While we in Thy house appear:</l><l>Here afford us, Lord, a taste</l><l>Of our everlasting feast.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
